Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a journey out to see the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,While I'm on my own, I've\Nyet to reach the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So won't you come along with me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely then, WE CAN!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me now as we\Njourney on from sea to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For that treasure known\Nby everybody as one piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though they laugh and\Nsay it's just a fantasy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going, there's no doubt we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we can feel the\Nrush of energy overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It will lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pretending that you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Books will only get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No guides for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The rain will be gone with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your chin up, raise the anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's what you'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it time and calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The storm that you have built within!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and have my board at number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Once tomorrow's wind picks up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.62,0:01:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We set stuff cause we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thresh it up, stand tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.98,0:01:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And take a look at one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All the journey makes\Nme want to see somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There are things out there\Nyou just won't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.38,0:01:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond your wildest dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think for a second\Nit's not the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.46,0:01:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the story most will believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me, come and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am on a journey out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.86,0:01:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my group of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Together we've got our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Says your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.10,0:01:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says it can't be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't even tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta just believe we'll\Nmake it to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna do it all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Together surely we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this moment in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this feeling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.18,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, we can?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes we can! Yes we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes the rain rupture!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.20,0:02:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a tidal wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.64,0:02:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to high ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.02,0:02:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll flood. Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right there. We're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Kinemond and Kanjuro are\Nclimbing the elephant's left leg slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, that accursed shaking has ceased.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.74,0:03:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what was the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.62,0:03:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare not wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.34,0:03:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My only concern is ascending this surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Be strong, Nicosiamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not tarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We must make haste before the sun sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this is too harrowing of a task.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.10,0:03:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.52,0:03:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cats are excellent tree\Nclimbers after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A fine point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.74,0:03:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Eeeeh! Eeeeh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.68,0:03:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Water? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.96,0:04:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's from a rain rupture\Nthat flooded the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be washed away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Necozymon was created from ink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that swift\Naction is necessary,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but what can be done\Nfrom such a height? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That was some rain, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite their name, rain\Nruptions aren't actually rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.50,0:04:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Twice every day, Zunesha\Nwill bathe itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, that was\Nseawater splashed on its back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The water passes through a filtration\Nsystem at the center of our city,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,then is sent through the aqueducts to\Nbecome a source of drinking water for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the whole nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky for us, fish come down with\Nthe water too, so we don't have
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,to worry about food either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rain ruptions truly are a blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.70,0:04:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.61,0:05:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Zohan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the bear guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.24,0:05:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of can't leave the forest right\Nnow, so next time you see the captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,tell him his crew's here\Nand he should visit us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.54,0:05:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.74,0:05:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That Bo was born here like all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.78,0:05:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's still a pirate, so we\Nkeep a close watch over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a guest of Cat\NViper, the forest boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's flooding!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.34,0:05:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a shark?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.34,0:05:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to be up that high.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're safe down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's seawater.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Met wasn't rain just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.80,0:05:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the giant elephant\Nwas cleaning its back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It was built to accommodate the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:05:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.14,0:05:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The forest, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the water's a perfect fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This flood must be a\Nregular occurrence, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that sounds like a real pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This island officially sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the rest of the crew quick\Nbefore we get soaked again you with me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's at the edge of town the flying\Nrabbit and the Nami dog lady are with
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,them They must have tricked him and now\Nthey're taking him to their evil lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop screaming what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.82,0:06:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's true. They must be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole city's soaking wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but it will drain shortly. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.74,0:07:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've told you, Karoo. He's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring him to me or I'll destroy this\Nwhole country. I've never met this person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,that you Karoo speak of so ask me all\Ndamn day but there's nothing i can do
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.40,0:07:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that guy's name\Nyou said earlier? The
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.26,0:07:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,one who attacked this\Ncountry before i came
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it's jack i saw his obituary\Nin the newspaper a few days ago
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.52,0:07:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,after wreaking havoc here he left and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,apparently attacked four\Nnavy vessels that were
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Transporting Doflamingo\Nto impel down, he was
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.54,0:08:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,able to sink two of them\Nin the battle but in the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,end he was defeated huh\Nthen he was right by
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,dress rosa one of the\Nships he attacked had
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.40,0:08:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,an admiral and the former fleet admiral on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.66,0:08:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,board jack certainly seems\Nto have a screw loose
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.46,0:08:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the article said his body wasn't\Nrecovered he's likely still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive that\Nmonster for what he did
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.02,0:08:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought this was the bright\Nflake. Why is it foggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the right flake You think\NZoro's group made it already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.44,0:08:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I would hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave them directions to our\Nhidden fortress a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.64,0:08:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Shambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look who it is! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.48,0:09:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No missing arms or legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't eat you, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Nami-dog lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.14,0:09:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our captain you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.40,0:09:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You voracious vixen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you want to gobble him up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.14,0:09:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You better give him back\Nalong with the rest of our
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.86,0:09:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,friends or I'm going to\Nmake barbecue out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.16,0:09:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever your impression is,\Nit's all wrong. No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here, so you'll understand soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.76,0:09:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there, within the fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.04,0:09:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There are guards and a\Ngate to our fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these the invaders?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta look like enemies to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.60,0:09:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,None of them meant any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They only went out into the whale\Nforest because they were lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't know they were supposed\Nto ring the welcoming bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:09:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:10:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Deliver this message for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat Pirates have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that who they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.56,0:10:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the crew are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.72,0:10:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.28,0:10:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to go see the rest of the crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.42,0:10:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're really here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.04,0:10:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, that's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.00,0:10:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They're at the fortress gate right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.70,0:10:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.90,0:10:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All your friends arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.90,0:10:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleased to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.90,0:10:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.72,0:10:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We have very important guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They are the friends of our saviors\Nand should be welcomed as such.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.58,0:11:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're pleased to have you there for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.34,0:11:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're ready to party!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't what I had in mind at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.78,0:11:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.56,0:11:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's "Crush" mean, anyway? That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.26,0:11:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that your race hated us humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.78,0:11:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Race, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a label that the ignorant\Ngive to other minx out of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.44,0:11:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,To us, what you, Tia,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.52,0:12:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,call humans are merely monkey\Nminx who happen to have less hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.88,0:12:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A different look, but\Nthe same race. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So no reason to hate humans\Nunless we give you one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.02,0:12:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't judge by one's differences,\Nbut rather by their character.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you deal well, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.56,0:12:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We full-body minks are certainly\Nproud of our fur, no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But a lesser mink coat\Ndefinitely has its charm as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,especially because they're rare here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, I see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.58,0:12:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nambi and Chopper are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's not a scratch on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nambi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.16,0:12:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nambi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.07,0:12:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy for your crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.42,0:12:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I got caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.36,0:12:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me through!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:12:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Crush! Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your crew will finally be together again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.40,0:13:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, so they don't hate us, but maybe\Nthey like us a little too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.16,0:13:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Goofy! Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe. Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.64,0:13:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumping!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.96,0:13:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.56,0:13:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So Sanji, Brook, and\NMomo are here too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sanji's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, the sun is setting already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.80,0:13:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose we'll have to return to the\Nship and resume our climb tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.26,0:14:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.54,0:14:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you're a man of taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.60,0:14:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have another cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.56,0:14:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We call this monkey wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.48,0:14:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We make plenty thanks to the\Nabundance of fruits in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.32,0:14:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's damn fine stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of the cuddles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm drinking here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.14,0:14:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, but it's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.78,0:14:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me get a devil, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let us go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one little lick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.77,0:14:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're weirding me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.69,0:14:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't be mean, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're giving us all this meat and\Nyou can't be nice for one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that our cultural practices\Ndon't give you a bad impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mingship expresses our tribe's\Ngreat fondness towards you, Tia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of meat is this? That's hippo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's lizard, frog, alligator.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.98,0:14:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't eat animals with fur, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.90,0:14:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not complaining, but why are\Nyou throwing us this huge party?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.72,0:15:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A friend of our saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.62,0:15:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,is a friend of ours, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Saviors, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They need the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.68,0:15:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Joy, I read about your big battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.16,0:15:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're all OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.58,0:15:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.96,0:15:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all banged up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.21,0:15:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.78,0:15:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've lost all face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.78,0:15:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I have one to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.18,0:15:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't Momo supposed to\Nbe with you guys, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and he's unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.62,0:15:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But the thing is, he's not very\Nfond of the makes. Well, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so nice to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.22,0:15:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true, but he's decided\Nto lock himself up in a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.02,0:16:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, that's convenient for us. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.84,0:16:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you explain that better?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're not making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just come this way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, all newcomers to Zoe, huddle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,First off, where did Kinemun go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.56,0:16:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We got split up, but\Nhe should be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.26,0:16:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it'll work out nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.28,0:16:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,While we're here, please do not mention\Nthe land of Wano or samurai either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Better not risk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.74,0:16:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It might cause offense to the minks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.54,0:16:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Or pain more accurately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It might even make them hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.02,0:16:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Make them hate us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.30,0:16:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but what's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.74,0:16:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with the samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.62,0:16:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something about this\Ncountry you didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So you thought you could get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.56,0:16:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't run now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.66,0:17:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, barren corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.36,0:17:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.14,0:17:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Once U-T-O reach right flank, that's\Nwhere you'll find your crew's corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.68,0:17:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.46,0:17:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So when she said there was a corpse,\Nshe was just talking about Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.14,0:17:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We call him that as a term of endearment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of misleading, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a lovely surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.26,0:17:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such an\Nalluring creature before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.26,0:17:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dog mains can't resist chewing a bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I don't see Traffy. Is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.16,0:17:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he said Baratie. He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, we should worry more about Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He left you a letter, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.16,0:18:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing will work\Nout one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.80,0:18:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.71,0:18:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.02,0:18:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm worried about!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole thing is way too fishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.12,0:18:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry. We...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.38,0:18:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,we couldn't do anything to stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.38,0:18:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't need to cry. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.06,0:18:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I don't know if it's\Nsomething to cry about or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.12,0:18:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is you need to give us\Nsome more details, because I'm lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.86,0:18:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I heard, Big Mom's ship was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know what happened\Nnext or how you guys got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.12,0:18:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's a giant elephant\Nand talking animal people
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.02,0:18:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and something bad happened\Nand the city got destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And I thought the Mink\Ntribe was our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But we got here and they all love us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're friends of their\Nsaviors, they're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.64,0:18:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hear the details in full.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.80,0:18:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us everything that's\Nhappened in the past 11 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,since you left Dressrosa aboard the Sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:18:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:19:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole situation has me worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.38,0:19:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll tell you\Neverything that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we ran into trouble when we\Nwere barely off the coast of Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.12,0:19:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The Big Mom Pirates appeared on\Na huge singing ship. Singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shipping, shipping!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.14,0:19:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We were able to spot\Nthe two members of her
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.58,0:19:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,crew that Luthi ran into\Nback on Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.74,0:19:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, confirming that\Nwe have located Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.92,0:19:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us send them on our bon voyage by seeking\Ntheir ship to recover Monsieur Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.66,0:19:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But they had company.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A fellow member of the worst generation,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.24,0:19:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Capone gang veggie seems like his\Ncrew is working under Big Mom now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.78,0:19:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They came for Caesar,\Nbut it wasn't a rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.02,0:19:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, he was terrified
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.46,0:20:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Although it's not like we\Ncould escape either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.72,0:20:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So even if it was crazy, we\Nneeded to do something in a hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.52,0:20:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's use a coup de burst to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the gout cannon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.48,0:20:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have enough spare cola for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.74,0:20:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a different plan this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever your plan is, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want them to\Ntake you, then play nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.22,0:20:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Brooke, we're gonna fight him\Nfrom the stern and create an opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.92,0:20:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Soul Parade!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.66,0:20:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper Robin, is that really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.10,0:20:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.14,0:20:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not approve of this bad one bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.96,0:20:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You will pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.12,0:20:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Some audacity treating me like a bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:21:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you stop resisting us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chopper. Nice bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He can fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.06,0:21:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.56,0:21:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, a prayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Spectre!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.36,0:21:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A room cannibals in our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.48,0:21:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The starbursts take a service, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.96,0:21:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.82,0:21:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Climb intact!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.64,0:21:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.34,0:21:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tag!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come hatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.90,0:22:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to lose\Nthem! What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.72,0:22:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you guys really kick some ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.24,0:22:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make me blush at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.78,0:22:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That was on the edge of my seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.24,0:22:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,New bird teamwork! You're\Nso clever. Oh, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.04,0:22:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'm awesome, but please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.82,0:22:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So you came here after that? How\Nlong did it take? So was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,to us at the time luckily we\Nmade it here the very next day
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.16,0:22:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So we've been here ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.66,0:22:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a question about the city
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It looked like the oldest sign of\Ndestruction was from about two weeks ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.54,0:23:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,so the incident was over by\Nthe time everyone arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.84,0:23:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.75,0:23:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When we found your friends here, most of\Nour country had already been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.38,0:23:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite that,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.44,0:23:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,their arrival was nothing short of a\Nmiracle for our people without their help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.40,0:23:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.36,0:23:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We owe them for their courage and\Nfor choppers medical expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.82,0:23:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone here in the mokumo\Ndukedom was nearly wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.72,0:23:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.68,0:23:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,wounds are still
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.59,0:23:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,pretty fresh on this whole?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.51,0:23:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you don't want to talk\Nabout it, I'm okay with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.38,0:23:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're allies now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.58,0:23:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You two need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.98,0:23:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I will tell you everything\Nthat happened that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.92,0:23:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.26,0:23:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The Duke is awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.84,0:23:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.42,0:23:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.33,0:23:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Emily!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.90,0:24:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Dogstorm, I was so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.50,0:24:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, I'll give him a checkup\Nand see what he needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.40,0:24:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, Miyagi, let's go! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.22,0:24:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,On my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.62,0:24:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, oh boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.94,0:24:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I have got to see the master at work!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.02,0:24:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.04,0:24:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyagi, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.20,0:24:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Dog Storm said he'd like\Nto meet with our saviors ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.46,0:24:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.38,0:24:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Yuti and your crew\Nplease come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.44,0:24:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.84,0:24:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But who's this dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.36,0:24:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the leader of the Mokumo\NDukedom, meaning the ruler of all Zo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.40,0:24:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He was hurt badly in the attack, and\Nunfortunately he's been in a coma ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.96,0:24:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Same as our other leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.80,0:24:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.71,0:24:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got two? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.72,0:24:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It may seem strange, but this is our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.56,0:25:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There is the King of\Nthe Day, Duke Dogstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.58,0:25:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And the King of the\NNight, Master Cat Viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.74,0:25:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, I heard the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.44,0:25:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice job beating Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.78,0:25:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it was really Straw Hat who did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.96,0:25:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's catch up back at the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.60,0:25:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.18,0:25:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.06,0:26:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, in an instant, it\Nall came crashing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.94,0:26:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The incident began 17\Ndays ago, to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.46,0:26:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A month and a half after\NBeppo and his friends arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.08,0:26:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the visitor spell rang out across\Nthe Mokumo dukedom once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.96,0:26:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Except this time, it\Nwasn't the welcoming bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.92,0:26:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather, it was a sound we\Nhoped we would never hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.08,0:26:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The raiding bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.84,0:26:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the welcoming bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.56,0:26:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the raiding bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.88,0:26:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.10,0:26:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A young lady like you,\NKaroo, wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.48,0:26:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's never been wrong in your lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.94,0:26:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A bunch of pirates broke down the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.42,0:26:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody get ready to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.30,0:26:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Trampling down the forest on the\Nway, they invaded our peaceful city.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.78,0:26:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling such a huge disturbance on\Nits back, Zunesha let out a roar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.04,0:27:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So who were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.54,0:27:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What did they even want from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.18,0:27:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They wanted something that\Nwe could not give to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.14,0:27:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Something we didn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.26,0:27:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Our pleas fell on deaf ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.52,0:27:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hiding a warrior\Nfrom the land of Wano here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.28,0:27:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hand over Race or we will\Nsmash this country to pieces!
